-- categories with Vietnamese descriptions — translated
UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Sale Up To 80% on products and accessories for bikers</strong></p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-287';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Moto Helmets — an Essential Piece of Gear for Every Rider</strong></h2>
<p>A motorcycle helmet is the most important piece of protective gear for anyone riding a motorbike or scooter. A quality helmet protects the head and reduces the risk of serious injury in the event of an accident. Bigbike distributes a wide range of genuine helmets from top brands such as LS2, AGV, HJC, MT Helmet, and Nexx — covering every type: full face, flip-up, 3/4, and off-road / dual sport.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-289';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2>Motorcycle Protective Riding Gear — Your Companion on Every Ride</h2>
<p>Motorcycle protective riding gear is an essential companion for every biker. Whether you are touring, commuting, or racing, quality riding apparel provides protection, comfort, and style. Bigbike offers a full range of genuine protective riding apparel from leading brands: Alpinestars, Taichi, Furygan, Scoyco, Komine, and more.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-290';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2>Riding Gloves — Essential Safety Accessories for Bikers</h2>
<p>Motorcycle riding gloves protect your hands in every riding condition. Quality gloves reduce the risk of abrasions and impact injuries to the hands and wrists. Bigbike offers a wide selection of genuine riding gloves from Alpinestars, Taichi, Komine, LS2, Furygan, and other top brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-291';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2>Motorcycle Protective Boots — Safeguarding Bikers' Feet on Every Journey</h2>
<p>Motorcycle protective boots protect your feet and ankles from impact and abrasion. Quality riding boots also provide anti-slip grip and waterproofing. Bigbike distributes genuine motorcycle boots from Alpinestars, TCX, Gaerne, Forma, SIDI, and other reputable brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-292';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2>Body Armor & Accessories — Enhancing Rider Safety</h2>
<p>Body armor and safety accessories such as knee guards, elbow guards, back protectors, and waist supports add an extra layer of protection for motorcyclists. Bigbike carries genuine armor accessories from Komine, Alpinestars, Scoyco, and other trusted brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-293';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Moto Touring Bags & Waterproof Bags — Essential Gear for Every Rider</strong></p>
<p>Backpacks, shoulder bags, and bike-mounted luggage are essential items for moto touring. They allow riders to safely carry personal belongings on long journeys. Bigbike offers a wide selection from Kriega, Givi, SW Motech, Enduristan, and other quality brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-294';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2>Bluetooth Helmet Headsets — Essential for Group Moto Tours</h2>
<p>Bluetooth headsets for helmets allow riders to communicate, listen to music, and receive GPS navigation while riding. An essential accessory for both solo and group touring. Bigbike distributes genuine Sena and SCS Bluetooth headsets.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-295';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Protective Gear Cleaning Products & Bike Care</strong></p>
<p>Proper maintenance and regular cleaning extend the lifespan of your riding gear and motorcycle. Bigbike supplies quality cleaning and care products including gear cleaner, chain lubricant, and LIQUI MOLY engine oils.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-296';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Rain Gear — Must-Have Accessories for Riders in Wet Weather</strong></p>
<p>Quality rain gear keeps riders dry and comfortable during unexpected downpours. Bigbike carries rain jackets, rain pants, waterproof gloves, and other essential rain accessories for bikers.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-297';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Replacement Visors & Pinlock Anti-Fog Inserts — Smart Fog Prevention for Riders</strong></p>
<p>Pinlock anti-fog inserts provide clear visibility in humid and rainy conditions. Compatible with most major helmet brands. Bigbike stocks a wide range of Pinlock inserts and replacement visors for LS2, AGV, HJC, MT Helmet, and other brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-298';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Other Accessories — Making Every Ride Safer</strong></p>
<p>A comprehensive range of accessories to enhance safety and comfort on every journey, including phone mounts, straps, seat bags, and more.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-299';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Touring Backpacks — Waterproof Backpacks for Bikers</strong></h2>
<p>Waterproof touring backpacks are a must-have for long-distance moto travel. Bigbike carries backpacks from Kriega, Taichi, Givi, and other reputable brands — keeping your belongings safe and dry on every adventure.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-301';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Full Face Helmets — The Optimal Choice for Maximum Safety</strong></h2>
<p>Full face helmets provide the highest level of protection, covering the entire head and chin. They are ideal for high-speed riding and long-distance touring. Bigbike distributes genuine full face helmets from LS2, AGV, HJC, MT Helmet, Nexx, and other top brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-303';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p>Textile riding jackets are not just fashionable apparel for bikers — they are essential protective gear. Made from high-strength fabrics such as Cordura and Kevlar with integrated CE-certified armor, textile riding jackets provide excellent protection while remaining lightweight and breathable.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-304';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Base Layer Accessories — Technical Apparel for Bikers</strong></p>
<p>Base layer accessories such as balaclavas, arm sleeves, undershirts, and socks are worn beneath riding gear to wick moisture, regulate temperature, and protect the skin. Bigbike carries base layer products from SIXS and other specialized brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-305';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Airbag Riding Jackets — Smart, Safe, Convenient, and Stylish Design</strong></p>
<p>Airbag riding jackets represent the latest advancement in motorcycle protection. They deploy automatically upon impact, providing outstanding protection for the chest, back, and shoulders. Bigbike carries the Helite airbag jacket — a world-leading airbag protection system.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-307';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Flip-Up Full Face Helmets — Safety and Comfort for Bikers</strong></p>
<p>Flip-up full face helmets combine the full protection of a full face helmet with the convenience of a 3/4 helmet. The chin bar flips up to allow easy access for eating, glasses, or ventilation at stops — without removing the helmet. Bigbike carries flip-up helmets from LS2, MT Helmet, and other leading brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-309';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Accessories & Phone Mounts for Motorcycles</strong></p>
<p>Motorcycle accessories and phone mounts make every journey safer and more convenient. Bigbike carries quality phone mounts and accessories from Quadlock, OSOPRO, and other trusted brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-311';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Thigh Bags — Maximize Carrying Capacity on Touring Rides</strong></h2>
<p>Thigh bags allow bikers to carry essential items such as phones, wallets, and keys within easy reach while riding. A practical and stylish accessory for every biker.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-312';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Leather Riding Jackets & Leather Suits — Essential Gear for Every Biker</strong></p>
<p>Leather riding jackets and one-piece leather suits offer superior abrasion resistance and a classic style. Ideal for track days, high-speed riding, and those who appreciate premium quality. Bigbike carries genuine leather gear from Alpinestars, Furygan, Spyke, and other leading brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-315';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>3/4 Face Helmets — Style Meets Safety</strong></p>
<p>3/4 face helmets cover the top, back, and sides of the head while leaving the face open. They offer a great balance between protection, ventilation, and style — a popular choice for city riders and touring enthusiasts alike. Bigbike distributes genuine 3/4 helmets from LS2, AGV, MT Helmet, YOHE, and other leading brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-318';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Hip Bags & Waist Bags — Convenient Companions for Riders</strong></h2>
<p>Hip bags and waist bags provide quick access to essentials while riding. Compact, lightweight, and easy to wear — ideal for both short city rides and long tours.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-319';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Riding Pants & Armored Riding Pants — Safe and Comfortable Companions</strong></p>
<p>Riding pants and armored pants protect the legs from impacts and abrasion. They feature integrated CE-certified knee and hip armor and are made from durable, weather-resistant materials. Bigbike carries riding pants from Alpinestars, Taichi, Scoyco, Furygan, and other top brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-323';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<h2><strong>Bike-Mounted Luggage — The Perfect Companion for Long-Distance Touring</strong></h2>
<p>Bike-mounted bags attach securely to the motorcycle to carry gear on long tours. Available as tank bags, tail bags, side bags, and panniers — from brands such as Givi, SW Motech, and Enduristan at Bigbike.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-324';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Off-Road & Dual Sport Helmets — Built for Every Terrain</strong></p>
<p>Off-road and dual sport helmets are designed for adventure riding across multiple terrain types — from dirt tracks to paved roads. They feature a visor peak and extended chin bar for superior protection. Bigbike carries genuine dual sport helmets from LS2, HJC, and other leading brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-325';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Underpants — Base Layer for Under Riding Gear</strong></p>
<p>Protective underpants are base layer garments worn under riding gear. They wick moisture, keep the skin cool, and reduce chafing on long rides. Bigbike carries base layer products from SIXS and specialized brands.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-4465';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Base Layer Top — Technical Undershirt for Bikers</strong></p>
<p>Base layer tops are worn under riding jackets to regulate body temperature and wick sweat. Essential for both hot summer rides and cold weather touring. Bigbike carries SIXS carbon fiber base layer products.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-4467';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Balaclava — Multi-Purpose Head Cover for All Weather Conditions</strong></p>
<p>A balaclava covers the head, face, and neck, protecting riders from wind, dust, and cold. It can also be worn as a base layer under a helmet for added hygiene and warmth.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-4469';

UPDATE categories SET description_en = $b$<p><strong>Socks & Arm Sleeves — Convenient Sun and Weather Protection Accessories</strong></p>
<p>Motorcycle socks and arm sleeves provide UV protection, abrasion resistance, and moisture management for riders. An essential accessory for comfortable all-day riding in the sun.</p>$b$ WHERE id = 'wp-cat-4471';
